{"id":"d_main_35_02","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch35","label":"Chapter 35 · Conversation"},"label":"Those Who Return","stage":"35-6 STAGE · Start","prev":"d_main_35_01","next":"d_main_35_03","speakers":{"rapi_red":"Rapi","cinderella":"Cinderella","laplace":"Laplace","grave_p":"Grave","drake":"Drake","maxwell":"Maxwell"},"icons":{"rapi_red":"si_c016_00_s","cinderella":"si_c511_00_s","laplace":"si_c100_00_s","grave_p":"si_c514_00_s","drake":"si_c101_00_s","maxwell":"si_c102_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_35_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_1","text":"This area looks safe.\nThere's no black water around here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Jungle1","bgArt":"jungle1","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_chapter35_field_swamp","movie":null,"shown":["laplace","cinderella","rapi_red","maxwell","grave_p","drake"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_2","text":"That may be true of this specific spot, but this area is teeming with black water. Leviathan could show up anytime, anywhere.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_3","text":"Although considering the beating she took before, it may be hard for her to do that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_4","text":"True. That last skirmish pushed her to her limits. She'll need a fair bit of time to recover, even if she is a Heretic.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_5","text":"She's probably on high alert, looking for any opportunity to turn the tables.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_6","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_6","text":"Rapi looks at me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_7","text":"I doubt she's been able to transform yet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_8","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_9","text":"Do you think she could be around here?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_10","text":"Are you asking me, Cinderella?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_11","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_12","text":"Then allow me to answer! I have no idea!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_13","text":"Thank you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_14","text":"Leviathan needs to replenish her Dark Matter,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_15","text":"which this place is teeming with.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_16","text":"She's almost certainly got to be around here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_17","text":"Were you talking to me, GraGre? I'll answer!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_18","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_19","text":"Actually, I guess I can't really answer, since it wasn't a question.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_20","text":"If she's around here, then where would she be?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_21","text":"She most likely...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_22","text":"would be in whatever place would be safest for her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_23","text":"In other words, where there's the most Dark Matter.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_24","text":"Since this is the entrance, all we can do is keep moving forward.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_25","text":"This entire area is surrounded by black water, so the route is restricted.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_26","text":"Right. Tracking her won't be too difficult.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_27","text":"So long as she doesn't run away, that is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_28","text":"From what I heard, you guys gave her quite the beating last time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_29","text":"How do we know she won't turn tail and run once she finds out you're here?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_30","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_31","text":"There's no way that will happen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_32","text":"How can you be so sure?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_33","text":"She needs to save Behemoth.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_34","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_35","text":"Leviathan ran away with Behemoth's core.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_36","text":"The core can apparently revive a Heretic.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_37","text":"This place is full of Dark Matter,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_38","text":"which somehow gave birth to the Four Beasts.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_39","text":"There must be a way for it to revive them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_40","text":"So she won't run. She won't leave this place.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_41","text":"... You're saying she'll stay to save her friend.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_42","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_42","text":"Rapi?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_43","text":"It felt to me like Behemoth and Leviathan were companions.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_44","text":"Their personal interactions felt different from those they've had with other Heretics, or Offsprings, as they refer to them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_45","text":"They protected each other and helped one another.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_46","text":"They've evolved.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_47","text":"Leviathan will come to us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_48","text":"She needs to revive Behemoth, and she doesn't want us interfering.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_49","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_49","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_50","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_50","text":"What do you want to do?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_51","text":"I want to figure out what the Four Beasts are after.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_52","text":"Once that's done, I'll decide.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_53","text":"Decide what?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_54","text":"Whether we keep fighting or not.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_55","text":"What? They're our sworn enemy. Of course we'll keep fighting them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_56","text":"... Then again, Marian and Cinderella ended up coming back to our side, so I guess it's not all that inconceivable to think we'd team up with other Heretics down the line.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_57","text":"It sounds like you know about my story.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_58","text":"Naturally. I was briefed before we came here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_59","text":"I realize most things about you are wrapped up in secrecy, but it'd be problematic to be working together without knowing this stuff beforehand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_60","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_61","text":"You don't have to look at me with such wariness, GraGre.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_62","text":"That's not my name.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_63","text":"Anyway, I don't trust humans.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_64","text":"But we aren't human.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"grave_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_65","text":"You live amongst them, and this is the first time we've met.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_66","text":"Are you looking for some form of reassurance?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_67","text":"Don't worry. We don't have a NIMPH.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_68","text":"...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_69","text":"We were corrupted, but were treated by the Vapaus.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_70","text":"So it was true that you were corrupted?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_71","text":"Yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_72","text":"But we cured it with our indomitable spirits!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_73","text":"I thought there was no truth to those rumors... especially given how you were acting.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_74","text":"I understand why you'd come to that conclusion.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_35_02_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_35_02_75","text":"But for all those reasons I just mentioned, no one else will get any information from us unless we